WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:31.490 --> 01:35.980
Noboru-sama. Let me prepare the supper tonight.

01:36.220 --> 01:37.030
What?

01:37.030 --> 01:40.050
Ko-chan, you're going to cook?!

01:40.260 --> 01:43.420
Yes. Even at the cost of my life.

01:44.170 --> 01:46.300
You don't have to go that far...

01:46.300 --> 01:49.270
But I bet it's nice to have a girl's homemade meal.

01:49.270 --> 01:51.700
Ko-chan, you do look like you're good at cooking.

01:52.310 --> 01:55.110
Yeah. I can't wait.

01:55.110 --> 01:55.940
- Yay! Yay! We'll get to eat Ko-chan's cooking!

01:55.940 --> 01:58.780
- This can't end well...
- Yay! Yay! We'll get to eat Ko-chan's cooking!

01:58.980 --> 02:03.940
Our Fox Deity, Harvests

02:11.190 --> 02:13.990
So what did Ko-chan say she was making?

02:14.500 --> 02:17.620
Miso soup with daikon radish and broiled fish.

02:20.640 --> 02:23.910
I'm hungry. Where's my food?!

02:23.910 --> 02:24.960
Stop it, Ku!

02:28.710 --> 02:30.150
What was that?

02:30.150 --> 02:31.740
Ko-chan, are you okay?

02:33.380 --> 02:34.970
I-I'm going to open the door.

02:39.690 --> 02:40.880
Ko-chan?

02:41.590 --> 02:46.320
I was just boiling some water, and...

02:47.930 --> 02:51.300
Oh... Uh, just put it to the side.

02:51.300 --> 02:53.600
I'll take it out on the day they
collect incombustible trash...

02:53.800 --> 02:55.330
I apologize.

02:55.540 --> 02:57.270
Don't worry about it.

03:04.780 --> 03:06.770
Is something in there?

03:08.420 --> 03:11.650
It is all right. No one is there.

03:16.620 --> 03:19.120
Yeah, I guess no one's in there...

03:23.500 --> 03:24.560
I'm home!

03:26.300 --> 03:28.430
I hope it pleases your tastes.

03:31.810 --> 03:33.780
It's a very... dynamic-looking meal.

03:33.780 --> 03:36.580
It's supposed to be daikon radish
miso soup and broiled fish.

03:36.580 --> 03:41.480
Oh. I guess things look different
depending on which region you're from.

03:45.990 --> 03:49.760
Noboru should've made it.

03:49.760 --> 03:52.530
I can't eat this crap...

03:52.530 --> 03:54.020
Hey, don't waste food.

04:03.540 --> 04:04.730
Ko...

04:05.010 --> 04:05.700
Yes?

04:06.270 --> 04:09.330
You really don't have to force
yourself to do this from now on.

04:11.980 --> 04:12.640
Okay?

04:16.750 --> 04:17.950
I understand...

04:21.060 --> 04:23.890
It's okay. I'll do it. Just don't move.

04:25.590 --> 04:27.860
I am sorry for all the trouble I have caused you.

04:28.360 --> 04:31.890
I only tried to be more like Noboru-sama...

04:33.100 --> 04:36.590
Well, he's been doing the household
chores for a really long time.

04:36.900 --> 04:37.800
A long time?

04:38.710 --> 04:42.840
Did he learn how to perform
household chores from Miyako-sama?

04:44.650 --> 04:47.480
I'm sure you'll get better at it with enough practice.

04:47.650 --> 04:49.810
At least you can cook rice normally.

04:52.720 --> 04:57.050
The one next to her is my brother.
He was really small back then.

04:58.360 --> 05:00.830
Come on, let's finish the dishes.

05:11.110 --> 05:12.970
This feels great!

05:12.970 --> 05:15.380
The things you see floating are yuzu!
Ko isn't doing it on purpose.

05:15.940 --> 05:16.310
She's only just a bit clumsy,
but she tries really hard.

05:16.310 --> 05:18.410
There are three types of hot springs here
in this land surrounded by mountains.
She's only just a bit clumsy,
but she tries really hard.

05:18.410 --> 05:20.150
There are three types of hot springs here
in this land surrounded by mountains.

05:20.150 --> 05:23.640
But those five dishes that she sacrificed...

05:25.950 --> 05:29.250
Six dishes and the pot...

05:29.690 --> 05:31.990
It's really going to cost us.

05:32.190 --> 05:35.290
To top it off, we have two more mouths to feed.

05:35.800 --> 05:39.030
No matter how I do this...

05:40.640 --> 05:43.040
We're in the red!

05:44.010 --> 05:49.340
At least I got this awesome free pillow out of it.

05:49.340 --> 05:52.780
The size and texture...

05:52.780 --> 05:54.620
It feels so good.

05:54.620 --> 05:55.510
Geez...

05:56.080 --> 05:56.950
Noboru...

05:57.550 --> 05:58.590
I'm done with the bath!

05:58.590 --> 05:59.640
Okay!

06:00.290 --> 06:01.090
Toru!

06:01.090 --> 06:02.020
What?

06:02.020 --> 06:03.830
Let's take the bath together.

06:03.830 --> 06:06.230
Why all of a sudden?

06:06.860 --> 06:10.430
Come on. We should strengthen
our brotherly bond...

06:10.430 --> 06:13.130
And save some money on the gas bill!

06:13.130 --> 06:15.730
I guess we have a lot of expenses this month.

06:16.040 --> 06:17.640
Well, that's that.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.200
Now let's go!

06:19.370 --> 06:20.270
Okay.

06:25.180 --> 06:25.980
Ko-chan.

06:26.380 --> 06:27.120
Yes?

06:27.120 --> 06:29.580
Do you mind if I use your room for a bit?

06:29.580 --> 06:30.210
Not at all.

06:30.690 --> 06:32.020
Ku-chan. Come with me.

06:48.440 --> 06:52.210
To tell you the truth,
I've always wanted to meet you.

06:52.210 --> 06:55.440
Did you hear about me from Miyako?

06:55.440 --> 06:56.240
Yeah.

06:56.240 --> 06:57.850
And you believed her?

06:57.850 --> 07:00.340
I didn't completely believe her at first.

07:00.720 --> 07:05.410
When you're around her, you get used
to all the strange things that happen.

07:06.490 --> 07:07.720
I see.

07:08.190 --> 07:14.220
Miyako was worried about you until the very end.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.330
Oh?

07:16.830 --> 07:20.630
It's true. I just wanted you to know that.

07:20.940 --> 07:24.530
Is that so?

07:28.980 --> 07:35.970
Miyako said she left the Mizuchi
household to go to school.

07:37.150 --> 07:43.220
Does that mean you and Miyako met at school?

07:44.930 --> 07:47.050
That's right...

07:48.330 --> 07:51.560
It was back when the new school
year for our college started.

07:52.230 --> 07:55.840
I lost the rock-paper-scissors
game in our club and ended up...

07:55.840 --> 07:57.370
Let's get away from the noise of the big city
and walk together, embraced by nature!
I lost the rock-paper-scissors
game in our club and ended up...

07:57.370 --> 08:00.580
Let's get away from the noise of the big city
and walk together, embraced by nature!
...wearing this huge and heavy
suit to welcome new students.

08:00.580 --> 08:01.340
Let's get away from the noise of the big city
and walk together, embraced by nature!

08:01.510 --> 08:02.810
And then...

08:03.340 --> 08:05.210
Wow!

08:05.210 --> 08:07.910
It's so cute!

08:09.020 --> 08:10.950
I want it!

08:11.450 --> 08:14.910
Hey, what's your name?! What's your name?!

08:17.060 --> 08:20.620
Miya! Miya, stop it!

08:24.230 --> 08:27.720
I wouldn't call it one of the
most romantic of encounters.

08:29.240 --> 08:31.230
I can tell you've been through a lot.

08:31.510 --> 08:34.740
And to think we would marry later on.

08:35.280 --> 08:38.180
Fate can really be strange at times.

08:39.010 --> 08:40.170
Yes.

08:41.220 --> 08:46.450
Miyako was able to find a
good partner in her short life.

08:47.620 --> 08:52.390
The Mizuchi shamans must be women.

08:52.630 --> 08:56.220
But those who become it are destined to die young.

08:56.630 --> 08:57.970
It's always been like this.

08:57.970 --> 08:59.030
But...

08:59.030 --> 09:00.770
You didn't know?

09:00.770 --> 09:01.560
No.

09:03.500 --> 09:08.240
Using mortals as mediums for the Five
Phases was reckless to begin with.

09:08.780 --> 09:10.240
As far as I know...

09:10.380 --> 09:14.210
...not one priestess has lived to see thirty.

09:15.680 --> 09:21.520
I see. Miyako was shouldering such a heavy fate...

09:23.720 --> 09:27.660
Haruki. Don't blame the Mizuchi for this.

09:28.700 --> 09:32.260
Their clan deserves some pity.

09:34.000 --> 09:35.700
What are you so surprised about?

09:36.000 --> 09:41.940
I just thought you held a grudge
against the Mizuchi family.

09:41.940 --> 09:44.610
A grudge? Me? On the Mizuchi?

09:45.050 --> 09:49.320
You were sealed away for hundreds of years, right?

09:49.320 --> 09:55.450
It's not like they abused you,
but don't you feel angry about it?

09:57.060 --> 09:59.620
I found it annoying in some ways.

10:00.060 --> 10:03.460
But that itself is insignificant.

10:03.730 --> 10:07.360
Insignificant? After all that...

10:08.140 --> 10:12.970
Wow, I guess you just think on
a completely different scale.

10:13.370 --> 10:14.840
It's amazing...

10:16.080 --> 10:22.310
When Miyako left the Mizuchi household,
she came to see me one last time.

10:23.450 --> 10:28.050
Say, what do you think people
can achieve in thirty years?

10:28.660 --> 10:30.750
They'll accomplish nothing.

10:32.560 --> 10:35.050
Is that what you think, Ku-chan?

10:36.030 --> 10:40.060
I think we can do anything.

10:43.570 --> 10:47.510
I see. I'm glad I got to hear to that.

10:48.840 --> 10:49.670
Thank you.

10:50.850 --> 10:53.870
We should just leave this matter at that.

10:54.120 --> 10:57.310
I'm going to watch TV so don't bug me.

11:14.140 --> 11:20.630
One, two, three, four...

11:21.080 --> 11:29.570
...five, six, seven, eight, nine...

11:30.350 --> 11:31.150
Ten!

11:43.000 --> 11:44.730
I'm off.

11:45.570 --> 11:51.030
Toru-sama, if you are going out,
allow me to go with you.

11:55.510 --> 11:56.780
It's okay.

11:56.780 --> 11:59.080
I'm just going to the bookstore.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.950
Just take it easy at home.

12:04.590 --> 12:07.350
Make the perfect lunch in no time!

12:07.350 --> 12:09.350
Chinese, French, or Italian!

12:09.620 --> 12:14.030
For the discerning individual who wants to
enjoy a delicious gourmet lunch on their day off!

12:14.030 --> 12:18.520
Noboru! I want to eat these things
they call "gourmet" once in a while!

12:18.800 --> 12:21.140
Where are we going to get the money for that?

12:21.140 --> 12:22.240
It's impossible!

12:22.240 --> 12:23.500
What?!

12:23.500 --> 12:26.060
We're on a tight budget because
our food expenses have increased.

12:26.570 --> 12:30.170
Unless a certain fox I know will
go out and get the food for us...

12:30.810 --> 12:34.710
So if I gather the ingredients, that's all you need?

12:37.820 --> 12:40.410
There's this thing I've been eyeing for a while!

12:40.550 --> 12:42.180
Just wait for it!

12:42.260 --> 12:43.690
H-Hey...

12:52.800 --> 12:53.830
What's this?

12:53.830 --> 12:56.770
That would be an edamame seed.

12:57.140 --> 12:59.440
Plant it and you'll get to eat
all the edamame you want.

13:20.290 --> 13:23.820
Wasn't our family budget tight this month?

13:31.070 --> 13:34.630
Good. Come to me...

13:34.910 --> 13:38.870
That troublesome fox isn't with you today...

13:48.260 --> 13:49.120
Want some help?

13:50.990 --> 13:51.690
Ko?

13:52.930 --> 13:56.690
Oh, I apologize. I'll finish this up right away.

14:00.840 --> 14:01.670
Noboru-sama.

14:01.800 --> 14:03.170
Yeah?

14:03.800 --> 14:09.870
Is it an act of rudeness for me to
ask Toru-sama about Miyako-sama?

14:10.810 --> 14:12.110
Did something happen?

14:12.280 --> 14:18.710
I just didn't want to be rude to my
master as a Mamorime of the Mizuchi.

14:21.520 --> 14:25.820
Toru doesn't have any memories of our mother.

14:26.430 --> 14:28.920
She just, you know, right after giving birth to him.

14:29.400 --> 14:34.490
Even so, he realizes how important she was to us.

14:35.640 --> 14:39.940
Maybe not knowing anything
makes him feel more guilty.

14:42.540 --> 14:47.500
Toru-sama feels hurt when I
speak about Miyako-sama...

14:48.450 --> 14:50.920
I am a failure as a Mamorime.

14:51.990 --> 14:58.220
I don't know what happened, but Toru
and I would never think of you that way.

15:00.630 --> 15:01.860
Noboru-sama...

15:02.200 --> 15:04.390
I must go find Toru-sama...

15:08.470 --> 15:10.200
I'll do the rest.

15:10.600 --> 15:11.660
Just go to him.

15:11.870 --> 15:12.500
But...

15:12.840 --> 15:14.640
It's okay. I'm used to it.

15:15.910 --> 15:18.170
Thank you, Noboru-sama.

15:22.420 --> 15:23.910
Now then...

15:35.200 --> 15:36.160
There we go...

15:38.230 --> 15:39.930
Wow...

15:41.170 --> 15:42.800
Want to climb to the top?

15:44.170 --> 15:45.000
Hiya!

15:45.270 --> 15:46.030
Um...

15:46.470 --> 15:50.570
Nice to meet you. What's your name?

16:07.490 --> 16:08.860
Toru-sama?

16:11.930 --> 16:13.770
Hey! What are you doing?!

16:13.770 --> 16:16.440
You're not allowed to catch the carp in the pond!

16:16.440 --> 16:19.170
What? I'm not allowed to?

16:19.510 --> 16:21.710
Why not?! It's just a few.

16:21.710 --> 16:22.680
Stingy people...

16:25.450 --> 16:27.350
This aura...

16:28.380 --> 16:29.180
It's close!

16:33.250 --> 16:33.840
Boo!

16:34.790 --> 16:38.190
Why are you running? I just want to be friends.

16:43.200 --> 16:45.600
You really live up to the Mizuchi brand.

16:45.600 --> 16:47.200
You look so juicy and delicious...

16:47.200 --> 16:48.690
Time to eat!

16:54.240 --> 16:55.230
A water blade?

16:55.780 --> 16:57.370
Release Toru-sama.

16:57.610 --> 16:58.600
Ko-chan!

16:58.880 --> 17:00.350
What are you?

17:00.950 --> 17:03.080
I am the Mamorime of the Mizuchi.

17:03.780 --> 17:07.280
I will not allow anyone to hurt Toru-sama.

17:08.590 --> 17:11.430
Oh? So you're a water spellcaster.

17:11.430 --> 17:14.830
Don't you think you're at a disadvantage
against a wood affinity yokai?

17:21.200 --> 17:23.200
Thanks for watering me!

17:23.200 --> 17:25.730
Here's a little gift in return!

17:30.080 --> 17:30.870
Ko-chan!

17:34.080 --> 17:35.510
Ko-chan!

17:36.680 --> 17:37.740
I'm all right.

17:38.150 --> 17:40.420
You're not okay! You have to run!

17:40.950 --> 17:43.920
I was unable to be of any help to you...

17:43.920 --> 17:45.360
But this time...

17:46.390 --> 17:47.950
Even if it may cost me my life...

17:48.530 --> 17:51.620
I will protect you, Toru-sama!

17:52.370 --> 17:53.770
Ko-chan...

17:53.770 --> 17:57.460
The life of a Mamorime is so meaningless,
don't you think?

17:58.440 --> 18:03.310
I'm going to devour the power of the
Mizuchi and live the life of my dreams.

18:04.980 --> 18:11.980
I wanted to eat you sooner,
but some woman's ghost was protecting you.

18:13.050 --> 18:16.510
Her powers finally weakened recently...

18:17.190 --> 18:20.350
Don't tell me that ghost is your mother.

18:24.260 --> 18:26.030
Am I wrong?

18:26.900 --> 18:31.670
You know, it's that annoying
little thing around you.

18:31.670 --> 18:33.200
Hold your tongue.

18:35.810 --> 18:39.270
I will not allow any more insults to be thrown.

18:41.520 --> 18:43.750
Ko-chan, what's that?

18:44.550 --> 18:48.210
Rinsenmon! You have a dragon inside of you?

19:06.710 --> 19:07.770
Why, you...

19:11.480 --> 19:13.510
Finished already?

19:13.510 --> 19:14.480
You play dirty.

19:16.020 --> 19:17.120
Toru-sama!

19:17.120 --> 19:21.780
Taking advantage of your weakness
is a nice strategy, don't you think?

19:28.000 --> 19:29.560
Don't move...

19:29.560 --> 19:33.000
Move and you know what'll happen.

19:34.600 --> 19:36.160
Yes, be a good girl.

19:37.910 --> 19:39.500
Bye-bye!

19:46.080 --> 19:48.050
Toru, you all right?

19:48.050 --> 19:49.170
Ku-chan!

19:49.480 --> 19:52.510
Ko-chan! Are you okay?

19:52.920 --> 19:54.350
Yes, I am all right.

19:54.860 --> 19:55.950
That's good...

19:57.860 --> 20:00.290
What's going on?

20:01.760 --> 20:05.060
I didn't know the Mamorime had this much power.

20:05.900 --> 20:10.170
You will face retribution for hurting Toru-sama.

20:24.150 --> 20:25.380
Wow...

20:29.790 --> 20:30.880
Ko-chan!

20:31.630 --> 20:34.560
I used too much of my power.

20:36.030 --> 20:37.700
Ow...

20:37.700 --> 20:39.830
Now then...

20:39.830 --> 20:43.830
Hey, bean. What is your name?

20:45.810 --> 20:47.540
That would be Mame Hisui.

20:47.540 --> 20:49.130
Good girl.

20:49.310 --> 20:52.850
But you're not going anywhere.

20:52.850 --> 20:54.370
Uh, excuse me?

20:56.420 --> 21:01.180
What a great find!
It was like an unexpected harvest.

21:01.260 --> 21:04.190
I'll admit, that bean girl
actually ended up being helpful.

21:04.190 --> 21:07.020
Don't call her bean girl. Her name is Mame Hisui.

21:08.700 --> 21:10.700
Oh, who cares anyway?

21:10.700 --> 21:12.220
You have to remember!

21:13.900 --> 21:15.090
Ko-chan!

21:16.100 --> 21:17.660
Thank you so much for today.

21:21.810 --> 21:24.970
I will be sure to protect you from now on as well.

21:39.430 --> 21:45.890
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:46.370 --> 21:53.570
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:54.940 --> 22:01.440
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

22:01.580 --> 22:09.220
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

22:10.120 --> 22:17.120
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

22:17.730 --> 22:24.230
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

22:24.470 --> 22:31.880
Daijoubu bokura wa hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:31.880 --> 22:39.520
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:39.520 --> 22:47.190
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:47.190 --> 22:58.400
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

23:04.340 --> 23:05.870
Okay, done!

23:07.450 --> 23:08.610
Wow!

23:08.850 --> 23:10.650
We have all the edamame we can eat!

23:12.490 --> 23:14.650
Maybe it needs more salt.

23:14.960 --> 23:15.850
Salt, was it?

23:16.220 --> 23:17.190
Allow me.

23:17.190 --> 23:18.090
W-Wait...

23:25.030 --> 23:25.330
Next Time

23:25.330 --> 23:29.300
Next Time
In their limited lives, humans continue to seek.

23:29.300 --> 23:34.880
Next Time
With their limited capacity in power and ability,
what they can grasp is minuscule.

23:34.880 --> 23:35.240
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Breaks a Taboo."

23:35.240 --> 23:37.710
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Breaks a Taboo
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Breaks a Taboo."

23:37.710 --> 23:39.610
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Breaks a Taboo
When love transcends boundaries...

23:39.610 --> 23:39.940
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Breaks a Taboo
